    <div class="field-visual__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg><span>Nhận diện.<br><b>Tự bảo vệ.</b></span></div>
